sequenceDiagram
    actor Officer
    participant UI as Officer Dashboard
    participant Controller
    participant DB as Database

    Officer->>UI: Enroll Student
    UI->>Controller: POST /students/enroll
    Controller->>DB: Create Student Record
    DB-->>Controller: Success
    Controller-->>UI: Show Success Message
    
    Officer->>UI: Create Timetable
    UI->>Controller: POST /timetables/create
    Controller->>Controller: Check for Conflicts
    Controller->>DB: Save Timetable Entries
    DB-->>Controller: Success
    Controller-->>UI: Timetable Published
